="lstnumberx9.19" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">=</span><span id="lstnumberx9.20" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">True</span><span id="lstnumberx9.21" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:70%;">)</span>
